; claude: the system applications (CATALOG.md's section): TinyTerminal,
; a VT100 and its shell over the playground's Teletype way and
; libs/terminal (plan_terminal.md), running appkits/teletype's
; programs. Laid out like office/: the programs here, software/ for
; the golden frames, web/ for the browser.
;
; What else it might contain, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - a desktop (the Xerox Star 1981, the Macintosh Finder 1984): icons,
;    windows, the trash, over the documents the office apps save;
;  - a file manager (Norton Commander, 1986): two panes of files;
;  - the desk accessories (the Mac's Calculator, Alarm Clock, Note Pad,
;    Puzzle): each a page long.
; Built on gui/ and the store (plan_io.md); see also the planned ix
; series, whose emulator would run on the Playground.
(executables
  (names TinyTerminal)
  (modules TinyTerminal)
  (libraries
    appkit_teletype ; the shell's programs, Tty_hangman, Tty_guess, Tty_wumpus
    basic ; and basic, Basic_session
    elm_playground
    elm_playground_native ; implem of virtual elm_playground
  )
)
